Package: com.phoni.downshot
Name: DownShot
Version: 0.1.0~beta1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Take screenshots with Power + Volume Down on iOS 12.
 Adds the combination to the native screenshot recognizer, while retaining
 the original Home + Power shortcut on the iPhone 6. No settings to configure.
 First beta: compiled and package-checked; needs testing on a physical iPhone.
Maintainer: Phoni
Author: Phoni
Section: Tweaks
Tag: role::enduser
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0)
